1	/**
2	 * dsh-oswyn/session/applier — orchestration of surface rewrites from an
3	 * assistant message's oswyn fences.
4	 *
5	 * Responsibilities:
6	 *   - Parse tool-result summary fences → plan (core/plan) → tool/result replace.
7	 *   - Handle discard / cascade → fold a span of failed calls to ONE user/message
8	 *     checkpoint (real negative delta via surface.appendCheckpointReplace).
9	 *   - Reply summary (dsh-reply-summary) → checkpoint-replace the assistant range
10	 *     with a memo (real negative delta). NEVER writes the old
11	 *     oswyn/assistant-summary append-only event.
12	 *   - prune-call / stub-call → prune tool-call arguments of the assistant message
13	 *     via core/projection and return a message-projection directive for the
14	 *     E-stage index to register (tool-call args cannot use surfaceOp).
15	 *
16	 * ALL kernel errors are caught and returned as {ok:false, reason}; nothing throws.
17	 *
18	 * @module dsh-oswyn/session/applier
19	 */
